209 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 169 0 R
/E (Every collection is crafted around a unique exploration of textiles, colours, patterns, and textures, resulting in pieces that feel distinctive, playful, and full of personality. Handmade in small batches, each scrunchie is created with care and attention to detail, ensuring that every product carries its own unique character and charm.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
210 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 169 0 R
/E (In a world where women often spend valuable time trying to perfect their appearance, Scrunch Ji offers a simpler alternative. The brand celebrates effortless beauty by providing accessories that instantly elevate any hairstyle without requiring hours of styling or complicated routines. Whether worn casually throughout the day or styled as a statement accessory for special occasions, Scrunch Ji scrunchies are designed to make women feel confident, expressive, and beautiful in moments big and small.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
211 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 169 0 R
/E (Inspired by creativity, individuality, and the joy of personal style, Scrunch Ji encourages women to embrace their uniqueness and wear it proudly. More than just a hair accessory, every scrunchie is a small piece of wearable self-expression designed to bring colour, confidence, and personality into everyday life.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
